%% Decision 11.6 + decision 012 — sub-order state machine. One transition(subOrder, event, actor) function; every
%% transition = conditional UPDATE + sub_order_events row + app.recompute_order() in ONE transaction.
%% Updated D4-B4 (26.11): purchase mode per sub-order (direct | platform), shipping waits for payment in platform mode,
%% system cancellation by the worker, ledger effects per mode.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> pending : checkout (buyer)<br/>ledger: platform = +sale and -commission, direct = -commission only<br/>mail: buyer confirmation, supplier new sub-order (direct now, platform after payment)
  pending --> confirmed : subOrder.confirm (supplier)<br/>allowed before payment<br/>mail: buyer
  confirmed --> shipped : subOrder.ship (supplier)<br/>platform mode only when the order is paid (domain + RLS), direct: no wait<br/>mail: buyer
  shipped --> delivered : subOrder.deliver (supplier)<br/>mail: buyer
  pending --> cancelled : subOrder.cancel (buyer, supplier, platform)<br/>or system: payment expired after 30 min, supplier API rejected a line<br/>ledger reversals per mode<br/>mail: the other party
  confirmed --> cancelled : subOrder.cancel (supplier, platform) or system<br/>ledger reversals per mode<br/>mail: buyer
  delivered --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]

  note right of cancelled
    Reason required. Buyer only while pending (and not while a card payment is pending);
    supplier and platform before shipped (platform audited).
    System cancel = app.system_cancel_sub_order(), worker only.
    Reversals: platform = -sale and +commission; direct = +commission only (no sale was booked).
    Cancelling a PAID platform sub-order makes the order refund_due until the refund row exists.
    Illegal transition on own sub-order = 409.
  end note
  note left of delivered
    orders.status (derived):
    all cancelled = cancelled
    all delivered or cancelled = completed
    otherwise in_progress
    orders.payment_status (derived, platform part only):
    due = gross of non-cancelled platform sub-orders, paid = receipts - refunds
    paid more than due = refund_due, due = 0 = not_applicable,
    paid = due = paid, otherwise unpaid
  end note
